{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40478","headline":"题昭州山寺常寂上人水阁 · 曹松","name":"题昭州山寺常寂上人水阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常寂常居常寂里，年年月月是空空。\n堦前未放岩根断，屋下长教海眼通。\n本爲入来寻佛窟，不期行处踏龙宫。\n他时忆着堪图画，一朵云山二水中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}